Package: oohead
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Depends: libc6
Description: Sovereign prefix line and byte extractor with early pipe closure semantics.
 Zero-copy prefix line and byte extractor with early pipe closure semantics.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 oote theme palettes, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
